Our rotary club raffle needs fair draws with no repeat winners, so I wrote this. Proud of it, so please be gentle but truthful!
```js
function draw(tickets, n) {
  const pool = [...tickets];
  for (let i = 0; i < n; i++) {
    const j = i + Math.floor(Math.random() * (pool.length - i));
    [pool[i], pool[j]] = [pool[j], pool[i]];
  }
  return pool.slice(0, n);
}
```

